<title>UK: Quality Care rises on news of possible bid.</title>
<headline>Quality Care rises on news of possible bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in nursing home operator Quality Care Homes Plc jumped on Monday after the company said it was in talks that might lead to an offer for it.</p>
<p>By 0755 GMT, shares in the company had risen 28-1/2p to stand at 302-1/2.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
